{
  "$defs": {
    "EvidenceObjectRef": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个 evidence 叶 / 索引对象的内容身份：`key + sha256 + size`（ADR-0077 §1.4，DQ-8 = a）。\n\n不含实现生成的 `uri`：同一内容在不同 warehouse 根下身份相同。`key` 只由 `sha256` 决定\n（`research/dataset-evidence/v1/<sha256>.jsonl`）；对象至少含一行 header，因此 `size >= 1`。\n\n**诚实边界**：对象是否存在、字节是否哈希成 `sha256`、长度是否为 `size`，属\n`StorageAdapter.lookup` 与 reader 的逐项核对。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.5.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "key": {
          "pattern": "^research/dataset-evidence/v1/[0-9a-f]{64}\\.jsonl$",
          "title": "Key",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "sha256": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Sha256",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "size": {
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Size",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "key",
        "sha256",
        "size"
      ],
      "title": "EvidenceObjectRef",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "EvidenceStream": {
      "description": "v3 manifest 承诺的有序 evidence stream（ADR-0077 §2；ADR-0094 §决策）。",
      "enum": [
        "members",
        "exclusions",
        "lineage",
        "evidence_gaps",
        "quality_reports",
        "chunk_proofs",
        "pit_conflicts"
      ],
      "title": "EvidenceStream",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一条 evidence stream 的根承诺（ADR-0077 §1.3、§3）。\n\n- `record_count`：流内记录数；`leaf_count`：叶对象数；`depth`：根索引所在层（至少 1，\n  单叶或空流也由一个根索引包裹）；\n- 空流（`record_count = 0`）没有叶；非空流至少一个叶，且叶数不超过记录数；\n  叶数不超过 1 时 `depth = 1`；\n- `root`：根索引对象的内容身份，经 manifest 内容哈希承诺整条流的顺序、计数与内容。\n\n**诚实边界**：fan-out 是规则参数，不在本对象内，因此 `depth` 与 `leaf_count` 的精确关系、\n各层 header 与子引用的连续性，由 reader / verifier 自根向下核对。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.5.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "stream": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/EvidenceStream"
    },
    "format": {
      "const": "hlens.dataset.evidence-jsonl@1.0.0",
      "title": "Format",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "record_count": {
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Record Count",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "leaf_count": {
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Leaf Count",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "depth": {
      "minimum": 1,
      "title": "Depth",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "root": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/EvidenceObjectRef"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "stream",
    "format",
    "record_count",
    "leaf_count",
    "depth",
    "root"
  ],
  "title": "EvidenceStreamRef",
  "type": "object"
}
